Derived portions of this product:

- `core/` -- a reorganized, self-contained copy of the rocq-mcp engine
  (pinned commit 6983113d0844c0b7f987c79dab13988445109bfb, version
  0.3.1) with the FastMCP layer removed.  Files were relocated and
  reorganized; implementation logic is unchanged.
- `server/tools/` -- verbatim ports of the upstream `@mcp.tool` wrappers
  (same tool names, descriptions, parameters, and function bodies).
- `tests/` -- upstream tests, with imports re-pointed to `core.*` and
  `server.tools.*`.

The unmodified upstream source is retained as the `third_party/rocq-mcp`
git submodule for reference and future syncs.  In accordance with the
Apache License, Section 4, modified files carry this notice; see
DEVELOPMENT.md for the upstream symbol map and sync policy.
